- Identity of additional core contributors beyond the 6 named pseudonymous handles — Discord/Forum suggest ~20-30 total
- Auditor/security firms that have audited Olympus V2/V3 contracts — not listed in Phase 1 sources
- Olympus Pro partner list completeness — blog post may not reflect current active partners